<task id="ExportClientCertificateInPKCS12Form-D9F567B9" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic task/task "><title class="- topic/title ">Export Client Certificate in PKCS12 Format</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Starting in <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/niagara4.15" class="- topic/keyword "/>, windows only supports exporting
a client certificate and private key in PKCS12 format. This procedure
explains how to export the client certificate in the <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/Workbench" conref="../reuse/WH_SoftwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009934.dita#WHSoftwareVariablesTridium-9A3264AE/Workbench" class="- topic/keyword ">Workbench</keyword> to authenticate the station via browser, without
needing the OpenSSL.</shortdesc><?Pub Caret 12?><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">export<indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">client certificate</indexterm><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">windows</indexterm><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">PKCS12 format</indexterm></indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><taskbody class="- topic/body task/taskbody "><prereq class="- topic/section task/prereq "> <ul class="- topic/ul "><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p "><keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/Workbench" conref="../reuse/WH_SoftwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009934.dita#WHSoftwareVariablesTridium-9A3264AE/Workbench" class="- topic/keyword ">Workbench</keyword> is running and connected to station.</p></li><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">You have already generated a client certificate, which places
certificate in <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">User Key Store</wintitle>.</p></li></ul></prereq><context class="- topic/section task/context "/><steps class="- topic/ol task/steps "><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">In  <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/Workbench" conref="../reuse/WH_SoftwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009934.dita#WHSoftwareVariablesTridium-9A3264AE/Workbench" class="- topic/keyword ">Workbench</keyword>, click <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Tools</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Certificate Management</uicontrol></menucascade>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Certificate Management</wintitle> view opens.<image placement="break" width="500" href="../graphic/CertificateManagementPKCS12.png" class="- topic/image "/></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">To export a certificate on the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">User Key Store</wintitle> tab, select the certificate and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Export</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Certificate Export</wintitle> window opens.</stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Do the following and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">OK</uicontrol>.</cmd><info class="- topic/itemgroup task/info "><ul class="- topic/ul "><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">For the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Export format</uicontrol>,  select the <option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">PKCS12</option> format from the drop-down menu.</p></li><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">In the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Private Key</uicontrol> section, click the checkbox
as <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Export the private key</uicontrol> and enter the password
in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Private key Password(required)</uicontrol>.</p></li></ul></info><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">File Chooser</wintitle> window opens. Save the certificate in the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">User Home</wintitle>.</stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Double-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">User Home</uicontrol> and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Save</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The certificate is exported successfully.</stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Navigate to certificate location and double-click the certificate.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Certificate Import Wizard</wintitle> opens.<image placement="break" width="400" href="../graphic/CertificateImportWizard.png" class="- topic/image "/></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Verify and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Next</uicontrol> to continue.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">File to Import</uicontrol> window opens.<image placement="break" width="400" href="../graphic/FiletoImportP12.png" class="- topic/image "/></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">To import the file, click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Browse</uicontrol> or continue with the existing file and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Next</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Private Key Protection</wintitle> window
opens.<image placement="break" width="400" href="../graphic/PrivateKeyProtectionP12.png" class="- topic/image "/></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Type the password and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Next</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Certificate Store</wintitle> window opens.<image placement="break" width="400" href="../graphic/CertificateStoreP12.png" class="- topic/image "/></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">To store the certificate, select the certificate as <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Place all certificates in the following store</uicontrol> and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Browse</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Select Certificate Store</wintitle> window
opens.</stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Select the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Personal</uicontrol> store, click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">OK</uicontrol> and <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Next</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Completing the Certificate Import Wizard</wintitle> opens.<image placement="break" width="400" href="../graphic/CompletingCertificateImportWizard.png" class="- topic/image "/></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Finish</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The certificate imported successfully.</stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">In the browser, enter the station address and press Enter.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The browser opens a window, prompting you to select a
certificate to authenticate yourself to the station.<image placement="break" width="300" href="../graphic/P12CertAuth.png" class="- topic/image "/></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">OK</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The station pre-login window opens.</stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Enter the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Username</uicontrol> and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Log in with SSO</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">Upon clicking the button, you immediately authenticate
to the station.</stepresult></step></steps><result class="- topic/section task/result "/><example class="- topic/example "/><postreq class="- topic/section task/postreq "/></taskbody></task>